  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FY24-25 ASEAN Food and Agribusiness Value Chains (Course 1) In-Country</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity is a short course which improves agricultural productivity and income in the ASEAN and Timor-Leste agricultural sector.
The course will equip scholars with the concepts, principles, and tools they need to leverage value chain approaches to enhance agri-food systems.
Course 1 will be held in April 2025.</narrative>
  </description>
